@startuml
!include style.puml
title Strategy: replaceable enemy decisions
abstract class Enemy {
  - behavior: BehaviorStrategy
  + setBehavior(behavior)
}
interface BehaviorStrategy {
  + desiredVelocity(enemy, world, dt): Vec2
  + name(): String
}
class PatrolBehavior
class ChaseBehavior
class FleeBehavior
class IdleBehavior
class AiSystem {
  + update(world, view, dt)
  + changeBehavior(world, enemyId, next, tick)
}
Enemy o--> BehaviorStrategy
BehaviorStrategy <|.. PatrolBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. ChaseBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. FleeBehavior
BehaviorStrategy <|.. IdleBehavior
AiSystem --> Enemy : chooses velocity
note bottom of AiSystem
All strategies read the same pre-motion WorldView.
MotionSystem applies their velocities afterwards.
end note
@enduml
